@Demo.OptimisticLock.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5120

### 健康检查
GET {{Demo.OptimisticLock.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 查询商品（预置 id 1、2，初始 version 均为 1）
GET {{Demo.OptimisticLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 创建商品
POST {{Demo.OptimisticLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "新商品",
  "stock": 10
}

### CAS 更新库存（成功后 version 递增）
PUT {{Demo.OptimisticLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "stock": 90,
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### 用旧 version 重放（expectedVersion 与当前不一致，返回 409 并附 currentVersion）
PUT {{Demo.OptimisticLock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "stock": 80,
  "expectedVersion": 1
}
